+#                     session's files.
@@ -10,1 sha256:74017b818ff9d85c91726ed91c3e3ff051afe0026551d0dab7859cc6d2852b19
+#                     entry. apply/drop by sha pass.
@@ -19,1 sha256:f81027e679a67581094443ac860ce2bcb33292bf2e0a07405757d43bb928875d
+# `yadm` (a git wrapper for managing dotfiles) is treated as `git`.
@@ -94,1 sha256:4a153c0c773e7c2aa6ee4365a0139bfd556dc9767abab813cff7dd9a1e098a28
+          fail("`git add -A` is blocked: stage by path. Where the worktree is $HOME it stages the home directory; " \
